From 7f89278481e72e091c84d01c98cfa4dbdf3207dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:32:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] use scudo allocator with vendor-overridable hardening toggles

grapheneos hardened_malloc and its userspace hardening knobs assume
pixel-grade kernels and vendor support. switch to the aosp scudo
allocator and gate the mte/tbi and thread stack hardening choices
behind vendor overridable properties; the toggles only exist because
of the allocator swap, so they are one change.
---
